  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1744681734_3776428_9a7aeb948e303b4ae9047f2633980e6a.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\" id=\"isPasted\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">🌸 About LalaMira</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"blank-line pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">LalaMira is a U.S.-focused children’s special-occasion dress brand, offering beautifully crafted dresses for every milestone – from first birthdays and baptisms to flower girl, pageant, and graduation celebrations.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">We design each dress with love and attention to detail, partnering with top factories to ensure premium quality, comfort, and quick delivery. Our brand is trusted by thousands of moms, event planners, and photographers across the U.S.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"blank-line pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">Joining our affiliate program means you are recommending a brand with:</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • ✅ High-Quality Products – Carefully designed and inspected before shipping.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • ✅ Strong Market Demand – Birthday and flower girl dresses are year-round necessities.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • ✅ Fast Shipping &amp; Easy Returns – 48-hour processing and worry-free returns build customer trust.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • ✅ Growing Community – 14k+ Instagram followers and thousands of happy customers.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"blank-line pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">⸻</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"blank-line pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">🤝 Commission Policy</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"blank-line pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">We value our affiliates and want to ensure fair attribution. Please read carefully:</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • Eligible Orders: Commissions are paid for orders generated via your unique affiliate link.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • Brand Keyword Policy: Orders generated from paid ads targeting our brand-related keywords (e.g., LalaMira, LalaMira dresses, etc.) will not be eligible for commission.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • Restricted Advertising: Affiliates are not allowed to bid on our brand name or misspellings in search ads, including Google Ads, Bing Ads, and other PPC platforms.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • Fair Play: Violations of this policy may result in commission cancellation and removal from the program.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"blank-line pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">⸻</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"blank-line pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\">💌 Why Partner With Us</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • 💰 Attractive 10% Commission Rate – Higher than industry average.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • 📈 Long Cookie Window – Get credit for sales up to X days after the first click.</span><br class=\"no-parse\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"></span><span class=\"pre-text paragraph\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"><span class=\"pre-text pre-text-normal win32\" data-v-7413f544=\"\"> • 🎯 Dedicated Support – Our team provides creatives, product updates, and marketing tips.</span></span></p></div>",
